{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在在乎的，是自己能否继续停留在这件尚未定形的事附近：即使内心一时更靠近、一时又退回，也不急着把其中任何一次变化当成最终答案。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1已经建立：面对真正重要而尚未定形的事，他首先在意的是能否不仓促定性地承认它；接近与收回可以同时存在，收回也不自动等于放弃。\",\"bridge\":\"正因为他已经允许“未定形”本身存在，当前反复出现的推进、收束和重新展开就不必被他分别解释成决定。他可以把这些不同方向的感受留在同一件事里，继续看它会成为什么。\",\"current\":\"因此这一段最值得解释的不是感受单纯变强，而是他在波动中仍维持着同一份关注：强烈时没有因此认定自己已经得到答案，退回时也没有立刻判定这件事应当结束。此刻具体在乎的是能否继续靠近而不被迫过早命名。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H1中“不仓促定性、收回不等于放弃”的经验，当前这些反复变化更容易被体验成彼此冲突的信号，需要不断判断到底该进还是该退；现在则能被容纳为同一段未完成经验里的不同状态。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\"],\"new_history\":[\"当一件重要但尚未定形的事使他的感受反复推进又退回时，他会把“是否还能继续留在它附近而不急着得出结论”当作眼下真正关心的问题。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H1实际改变了对当前波动的解释：不是仅增加投入程度，而是让推进与退回不再各自承担结论功能。没有把力度或织体变化写成对方回应、关系进展或外部事件；新增事实只限定为他面对未定形重要事项时的关注方式。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "47324b81-a0c6-40c0-94a5-39ea076c61cd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215353013821Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.782, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:54:16.781413+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f95c62c161bd04688e6db7343bda30807967c5874e6a58b25fced1fbf715acd6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215353013821Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ca275a1e045bbbd871e8368c2ab1f8eaf4f3535062af43e2da50ccb0c9edb354"}}}
